an esteemed collection of actors have  played batman over the decades and  robert pattinson is the newest to join  their ranks how is his bat suit distinct  from the others keep watching for all  the tactical distinctions  adam west michael keaton val kilmer  george clooney christian bale and ben  affleck have all had their own versions  of the bat suit if not multiple  variations on it batman's gear is an  integral part translating the more than  80 year old character from comics to the  screen while costume designers get  considerable creative license on other  productions comic book adaptations have  to walk a fine line between translating  costumes that look great in the  fantastical worlds of comics into a  realistic film version  what gives you the right what's the  difference between you and me i'm not  wearing hockey pads  what did costume supervisor dave  crossman and concept artist glenn dillon  do differently for the batman pattinson  who originally screen tested for the  role wearing a version of the val kilmer  bat batsuit told entertainment weekly  about his official costume i felt very  different immediately it really flowed  it was so well designed so articulated  on all the joints it was kind of  shocking you're trying to get under my  cape doctor as cool as the bat suit  always looked freedom of movement has  not always been high on the priority  list for the costume designers  pattinson's version of the suit makes  some accommodations for that it has a  collar at the top of the cape around the  neck while this may look strange to  comic book fans it gives batman  protection around his vulnerable neck  area while still enabling him to turn  his head in his own interview with  entertainment weekly the batman director  matt reeves explained part of the  tradition is that when you're playing  batman you don't just do an audition you  do a screen test and they need to see  you in a bat suit but they don't make  you a bat suit because that's a very  involved process so what you do is you  put on an old bat suit pattinson  struggled with the heat and the lack of  movement in kilmer's version the costume  that was custom made for him by contrast  was almost too comfortable patinson told  ew in the costume fitting i ended up  doing loads of somersaults and stuff and  then they added all those into the fight  scenes you can do like a couple of  somersaults in it but it really gets old  pretty quickly reeves and his design  team seem to have ditched the solid  rubber of past bat suits adopting  something resembling an actual battle  suit it all fits with the director's  vision of a more realistic gritty hero  fighting for his life crossman and dylan  worked hard to echo that sentiment in  the suit pattinson told ew there are  little blood stains on it there's kind  of grazes where it's been hit with  bullets and kind of just the wear and  tear of someone who's been out fighting  every night it looks like a soldier's  armor in some kind of strange parallel  universe where you have to wear little  ears on top of your head as well but  what about batman's all-important  gadgets  while batman's comics costume places the  majority of his gadgets in his utility  belt pattinson's batman has a more  modular and tactical approach with  devices and weapons built in everywhere  he said the grapple gun is i think in  every single batman movie but i'm not  sure how many times he used them so  defensively it's used as a weapon it's  kind of based on travis bickle the gun  mechanism which he has in taxi driver  there is also apparently a unique use  for the bat symbol on his chest we can't  wait to see pattinson explained it's a  tool which he can pop out of the chest  plate which is kind of amazing  incredibly difficult to design as well  and looks great wait like in superman 2  probably not there also seems to be a  gadget hidden on batman's leg during a  chase scene with the penguin batman  causes him to flip his car there's a  visible bulge on batman's right thigh is  it a weapon a gas mask like soldiers in  the field carry we'll find out when the  batman comes to theaters march 4th 2022  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the batman are coming soon subscribe to  our youtube channel and hit the bell so  you don't miss a single one
 

